      "content": "small talk with a barista doesnt change the fact that i dont actually matter. i spend all day thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasnt a burden or a ghost. if i just disappeared, would anyone even notice a gap was left? or would the world just keep moving like nothing happened?",
